E AX3025 620-show-refusals.ax:53:16-17 trait-impl "`show` cannot render `Holder`: it holds a `Foreign`, which has no rendering" #"no rendering derived" !"a rendering is derived from the static type at compile time, field by field, and a type the compiler cannot take apart has none" ?"give the field a type `show` can render, or write a function that renders this type and interpolate its result"
